WEBVTT

00:07:29.407 --> 00:07:30.692
health care,

00:07:30.716 --> 00:07:32.265
economic opportunity,

00:07:32.289 --> 00:07:33.517
jobs.

00:07:34.522 --> 00:07:38.677
This creates the perfect breeding ground
for corruption to thrive.

00:07:39.884 --> 00:07:43.088
Now, in no way does this
excuse corrupt behavior.

00:07:43.112 --> 00:07:45.998
It just helps us
understand it a bit better.

00:07:46.672 --> 00:07:50.493
Investing in businesses
that make things affordable

00:07:50.517 --> 00:07:52.999
and accessible to so many more people

00:07:53.023 --> 00:07:54.740
attacks this scarcity

00:07:54.764 --> 00:07:59.297
and creates the revenues for governments
to reinvest in their economies.

00:07:59.992 --> 00:08:03.128
Now, when this happens
on a countrywide level,